{"status": "ok", "language": null, "cues": [{"t": 0.0, "d": 1.2, "text": "要不要出来玩？"}, {"t": 2.33, "d": 0.9, "text": "出来玩。"}, {"t": 4.9, "d": 0.8, "text": "大家好。"}, {"t": 6.3, "d": 4.13, "text": "我现在在公园。"}, {"t": 13.3, "d": 2.3, "text": "我的身上"}, {"t": 15.9, "d": 3.7, "text": "背着一个包。"}, {"t": 22.83, "d": 3.63, "text": "包里面有什么东西呢？"}, {"t": 27.1, "d": 1.8, "text": "我们待会儿揭晓。"}, {"t": 29.3, "d": 4.03, "text": "我们现在一起逛逛公园。"}, {"t": 39.0, "d": 2.63, "text": "这是一棵大树。"}, {"t": 45.1, "d": 2.7, "text": "这是它的树干。"}, {"t": 51.7, "d": 2.4, "text": "这是它的根须。"}, {"t": 55.5, "d": 2.83, "text": "这是无人售货机。"}, {"t": 59.03, "d": 1.4, "text": "都是饮料，"}, {"t": 61.0, "d": 1.1, "text": "补水的。"}, {"t": 63.5, "d": 2.83, "text": "这是一个小山坡。"}, {"t": 67.63, "d": 2.73, "text": "上面长满了草。"}, {"t": 73.5, "d": 4.0, "text": "前面有人在拍婚纱照。"}, {"t": 79.7, "d": 2.43, "text": "好几对的新人"}, {"t": 82.13, "d": 2.5, "text": "在拍婚纱照。"}, {"t": 87.33, "d": 1.2, "text": "一对。"}, {"t": 90.9, "d": 1.3, "text": "两对。"}, {"t": 93.33, "d": 1.2, "text": "三对。"}, {"t": 103.4, "d": 1.1, "text": "四对。"}, {"t": 106.8, "d": 3.2, "text": "他们在这边拍婚纱照。"}, {"t": 117.63, "d": 3.53, "text": "前面有两个女生在拍照。"}, {"t": 128.0, "d": 3.7, "text": "有一个环卫工人在扫地。"}, {"t": 135.7, "d": 2.5, "text": "她在扫落叶。"}, {"t": 143.07, "d": 2.47, "text": "这是落叶。"}, {"t": 146.0, "d": 1.1, "text": "落叶。"}, {"t": 148.3, "d": 1.8, "text": "变黄了。"}, {"t": 152.73, "d": 2.5, "text": "口渴了。"}, {"t": 158.5, "d": 2.23, "text": "喝口水。"}, {"t": 162.37, "d": 1.7, "text": "拧开瓶盖。"}, {"t": 164.5, "d": 3.6, "text": "这是拧开瓶盖。"}, {"t": 168.67, "d": 1.6, "text": "这是瓶盖。"}, {"t": 171.87, "d": 1.73, "text": "这是瓶子。"}, {"t": 174.1, "d": 2.83, "text": "里面装着水。"}, {"t": 177.9, "d": 4.13, "text": "我现在要喝水。"}, {"t": 185.7, "d": 3.8, "text": "现在来看一下包里有什么东西。"}, {"t": 192.97, "d": 2.23, "text": "包里有一本书。"}, {"t": 196.4, "d": 2.33, "text": "一本书。"}, {"t": 201.07, "d": 4.1, "text": "我要在这边看书。"}, {"t": 205.57, "d": 1.7, "text": "翻开书。"}, {"t": 207.67, "d": 0.8, "text": "看。"}, {"t": 210.2, "d": 3.43, "text": "我在看书。"}, {"t": 214.67, "d": 2.33, "text": "这是耳机。"}, {"t": 218.4, "d": 1.3, "text": "我要听音乐。"}, {"t": 219.87, "d": 2.4, "text": "这是耳机。"}, {"t": 222.7, "d": 1.93, "text": "塞在耳朵里。"}, {"t": 231.57, "d": 2.2, "text": "选择音乐。"}, {"t": 235.6, "d": 4.13, "text": "感谢生命这美好的……"}, {"t": 242.27, "d": 2.9, "text": "送你一首白居易的诗。"}, {"t": 246.1, "d": 3.03, "text": "离离原上草，"}, {"t": 249.6, "d": 2.3, "text": "一岁一枯荣。"}, {"t": 252.6, "d": 1.9, "text": "野火烧不尽，"}, {"t": 254.6, "d": 2.8, "text": "春风吹又生。"}, {"t": 257.5, "d": 2.7, "text": "远芳侵古道，"}, {"t": 260.3, "d": 3.2, "text": "晴翠接荒城。"}, {"t": 263.6, "d": 2.93, "text": "又送王孙去，"}, {"t": 266.67, "d": 3.83, "text": "萋萋满别情。"}, {"t": 271.7, "d": 3.4, "text": "阳光穿过树林，"}, {"t": 275.7, "d": 3.7, "text": "照射在书本上。"}, {"t": 280.7, "d": 4.2, "text": "太阳照在我的脸上。"}, {"t": 286.7, "d": 2.73, "text": "阳光很刺眼。"}, {"t": 290.67, "d": 2.63, "text": "我睁不开眼。"}, {"t": 300.07, "d": 3.43, "text": "我走在树林当中。"}, {"t": 304.27, "d": 2.3, "text": "这些都是树。"}, {"t": 310.7, "d": 3.33, "text": "现在我要回家了。"}, {"t": 314.17, "d": 4.03, "text": "把书放进书包里。"}, {"t": 319.47, "d": 2.63, "text": "放进去。"}, {"t": 323.1, "d": 1.3, "text": "拉上拉链。"}, {"t": 326.77, "d": 2.0, "text": "背在身上。"}, {"t": 330.27, "d": 1.07, "text": "背在身上。"}, {"t": 331.67, "d": 1.83, "text": "我们可以走了。"}, {"t": 334.67, "d": 3.1, "text": "这是一块大草坪。"}, {"t": 338.8, "d": 1.4, "text": "有鸟。"}, {"t": 340.7, "d": 0.6, "text": "你看。"}, {"t": 342.4, "d": 1.9, "text": "鸟在草地上。"}, {"t": 348.6, "d": 1.7, "text": "飞起来了。"}, {"t": 350.43, "d": 2.9, "text": "这一大片的水是海。"}, {"t": 358.27, "d": 2.7, "text": "对面有高楼。"}, {"t": 365.9, "d": 2.2, "text": "这是海水。"}, {"t": 368.47, "d": 1.4, "text": "那是太阳。"}, {"t": 370.53, "d": 2.33, "text": "太阳要落山了。"}, {"t": 373.83, "d": 4.13, "text": "太阳的倒影在海面上。"}, {"t": 378.1, "d": 2.03, "text": "这是栏杆。"}, {"t": 381.1, "d": 2.23, "text": "这是救生圈。"}, {"t": 384.4, "d": 2.4, "text": "这是钓鱼竿。"}, {"t": 387.2, "d": 2.33, "text": "有人在钓鱼。"}, {"t": 390.23, "d": 2.6, "text": "前面有人在钓鱼。"}, {"t": 393.33, "d": 2.5, "text": "这是沙子。"}, {"t": 395.87, "d": 2.9, "text": "小朋友在玩沙子。"}, {"t": 399.87, "d": 2.3, "text": "我们从出口出去。"}, {"t": 403.97, "d": 2.33, "text": "我们现在出来了。"}, {"t": 406.4, "d": 2.2, "text": "从公园里面出来了。"}, {"t": 409.2, "d": 2.43, "text": "现在几点了？"}, {"t": 411.63, "d": 3.7, "text": "现在是下午五点半。"}, {"t": 416.03, "d": 2.0, "text": "回家吃饭了。"}], "en_cues": [{"t": 0.0, "d": 1.2, "text": "Want to come out and have some fun?"}, {"t": 2.33, "d": 0.9, "text": "Come on out!"}, {"t": 4.9, "d": 0.8, "text": "Hi, everyone!"}, {"t": 6.3, "d": 4.13, "text": "I'm at the park now."}, {"t": 13.3, "d": 2.3, "text": "On my back,"}, {"t": 15.9, "d": 3.7, "text": "I'm carrying a bag."}, {"t": 22.83, "d": 3.63, "text": "What's inside the bag?"}, {"t": 27.1, "d": 1.8, "text": "We'll find out in a little while."}, {"t": 29.3, "d": 4.03, "text": "Let's walk around the park together."}, {"t": 39.0, "d": 2.63, "text": "This is a big tree."}, {"t": 45.1, "d": 2.7, "text": "This is its trunk."}, {"t": 51.7, "d": 2.4, "text": "These are its roots."}, {"t": 55.5, "d": 2.83, "text": "This is a vending machine."}, {"t": 59.03, "d": 1.4, "text": "These are all drinks,"}, {"t": 61.0, "d": 1.1, "text": "to keep you hydrated."}, {"t": 63.5, "d": 2.83, "text": "This is a small hill."}, {"t": 67.63, "d": 2.73, "text": "It's covered in grass."}, {"t": 73.5, "d": 4.0, "text": "People are taking wedding photos up ahead."}, {"t": 79.7, "d": 2.43, "text": "Several couples"}, {"t": 82.13, "d": 2.5, "text": "are taking wedding photos."}, {"t": 87.33, "d": 1.2, "text": "One couple."}, {"t": 90.9, "d": 1.3, "text": "Two couples."}, {"t": 93.33, "d": 1.2, "text": "Three couples."}, {"t": 103.4, "d": 1.1, "text": "Four couples."}, {"t": 106.8, "d": 3.2, "text": "They're taking wedding photos here."}, {"t": 117.63, "d": 3.53, "text": "Two young women are taking photos up ahead."}, {"t": 128.0, "d": 3.7, "text": "A sanitation worker is sweeping the ground."}, {"t": 135.7, "d": 2.5, "text": "She's sweeping up fallen leaves."}, {"t": 143.07, "d": 2.47, "text": "This is a fallen leaf."}, {"t": 146.0, "d": 1.1, "text": "A fallen leaf."}, {"t": 148.3, "d": 1.8, "text": "It's turned yellow."}, {"t": 152.73, "d": 2.5, "text": "I'm thirsty."}, {"t": 158.5, "d": 2.23, "text": "I'll have a sip of water."}, {"t": 162.37, "d": 1.7, "text": "Unscrew the bottle cap."}, {"t": 164.5, "d": 3.6, "text": "This is how you unscrew the bottle cap."}, {"t": 168.67, "d": 1.6, "text": "This is the bottle cap."}, {"t": 171.87, "d": 1.73, "text": "This is the bottle."}, {"t": 174.1, "d": 2.83, "text": "There's water inside."}, {"t": 177.9, "d": 4.13, "text": "I'm going to drink some water now."}, {"t": 185.7, "d": 3.8, "text": "Now let's see what's inside the bag."}, {"t": 192.97, "d": 2.23, "text": "There's a book in the bag."}, {"t": 196.4, "d": 2.33, "text": "A book."}, {"t": 201.07, "d": 4.1, "text": "I'm going to read here."}, {"t": 205.57, "d": 1.7, "text": "Open the book."}, {"t": 207.67, "d": 0.8, "text": "Read."}, {"t": 210.2, "d": 3.43, "text": "I'm reading."}, {"t": 214.67, "d": 2.33, "text": "These are earbuds."}, {"t": 218.4, "d": 1.3, "text": "I'll listen to music."}, {"t": 219.87, "d": 2.4, "text": "These are earbuds."}, {"t": 222.7, "d": 1.93, "text": "Put them in my ears."}, {"t": 231.57, "d": 2.2, "text": "Choose some music."}, {"t": 235.6, "d": 4.13, "text": "Thank you, life, for this wonderful…"}, {"t": 242.27, "d": 2.9, "text": "Here's a poem by Bai Juyi for you."}, {"t": 246.1, "d": 3.03, "text": "Boundless grasses over the plain"}, {"t": 249.6, "d": 2.3, "text": "Come and go with every season;"}, {"t": 252.6, "d": 1.9, "text": "Wildfire never quite consumes them—"}, {"t": 254.6, "d": 2.8, "text": "They are tall once more in the spring wind."}, {"t": 257.5, "d": 2.7, "text": "Sweet they press on the old high-road"}, {"t": 260.3, "d": 3.2, "text": "And reach the crumbling city-gate. . . ."}, {"t": 263.6, "d": 2.93, "text": "O Prince of Friends, you are gone again. . .\n."}, {"t": 266.67, "d": 3.83, "text": "I hear them sighing after you."}, {"t": 271.7, "d": 3.4, "text": "The sunlight comes through the trees"}, {"t": 275.7, "d": 3.7, "text": "and shines on the book."}, {"t": 280.7, "d": 4.2, "text": "The sun is shining on my face."}, {"t": 286.7, "d": 2.73, "text": "The sunlight is dazzling."}, {"t": 290.67, "d": 2.63, "text": "I can't keep my eyes open."}, {"t": 300.07, "d": 3.43, "text": "I'm walking among the trees."}, {"t": 304.27, "d": 2.3, "text": "These are all trees."}, {"t": 310.7, "d": 3.33, "text": "I'm going home now."}, {"t": 314.17, "d": 4.03, "text": "Put the book into the backpack."}, {"t": 319.47, "d": 2.63, "text": "Put it in."}, {"t": 323.1, "d": 1.3, "text": "Zip it up."}, {"t": 326.77, "d": 2.0, "text": "Put it on my back."}, {"t": 330.27, "d": 1.07, "text": "Put it on my back."}, {"t": 331.67, "d": 1.83, "text": "We can go now."}, {"t": 334.67, "d": 3.1, "text": "This is a large lawn."}, {"t": 338.8, "d": 1.4, "text": "There's a bird."}, {"t": 340.7, "d": 0.6, "text": "Look!"}, {"t": 342.4, "d": 1.9, "text": "The bird is on the grass."}, {"t": 348.6, "d": 1.7, "text": "It flew away."}, {"t": 350.43, "d": 2.9, "text": "This large body of water is the sea."}, {"t": 358.27, "d": 2.7, "text": "There are tall buildings on the other side."}, {"t": 365.9, "d": 2.2, "text": "This is seawater."}, {"t": 368.47, "d": 1.4, "text": "That's the sun."}, {"t": 370.53, "d": 2.33, "text": "The sun is setting."}, {"t": 373.83, "d": 4.13, "text": "The sun's reflection is on the sea."}, {"t": 378.1, "d": 2.03, "text": "This is a railing."}, {"t": 381.1, "d": 2.23, "text": "This is a lifebuoy."}, {"t": 384.4, "d": 2.4, "text": "This is a fishing rod."}, {"t": 387.2, "d": 2.33, "text": "Someone is fishing."}, {"t": 390.23, "d": 2.6, "text": "Someone is fishing up ahead."}, {"t": 393.33, "d": 2.5, "text": "This is sand."}, {"t": 395.87, "d": 2.9, "text": "Children are playing in the sand."}, {"t": 399.87, "d": 2.3, "text": "Let's go out through the exit."}, {"t": 403.97, "d": 2.33, "text": "We're outside now."}, {"t": 406.4, "d": 2.2, "text": "We've come out of the park."}, {"t": 409.2, "d": 2.43, "text": "What time is it now?"}, {"t": 411.63, "d": 3.7, "text": "It's five thirty in the afternoon."}, {"t": 416.03, "d": 2.0, "text": "Time to go home and eat."}], "video_id": "6sjACR7dUK4"}